# Veetee VT420 80-column — an original bitmap typeface in the style of
# DEC VT420 and VT500-series terminals, on their 10x16 dot cell for 24-line
# screens (EK-VT420-RM table 5-5). Pixels are 1:1.4, so the cell draws
# taller than it is wide. Rows 0-2 hold accents, capitals are rows 3-12,
# lowercase x-height rows 6-12, descenders rows 13-15; the glyph body is
# columns 1-7 and dot stretching adds half a dot to the right. Line
# drawing meets at column 4, row 7; scan lines 1, 3, 5, 7 and 9 are rows
# 0, 4, 7, 11 and 15.
#
# Copyright 2026 The veetee Authors. Licensed under the SIL Open Font
# License, Version 1.1 (see OFL.txt).
#
# Format: "cell W H", then for each glyph a "U+XXXX" line followed by H
# rows of W characters, "#" for a lit dot and "." for dark.

